  "configuration_id": "config_048",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion achieve top performance. This experiment tests using resnet50 image encoder with pca_n2000 RNA encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion to isolate the impact of image encoder and RNA encoder choices. It clarifies whether resnet50 (vs imagenet_vit_l) or pca_n2000 (vs scvi_n200) affects performance, while maintaining transformer aggregation and weighted fusion, which are already shown to be effective."
}

